  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:11.630" end="00:14.100" ttm:agent="v1">Slide on a pimp game with my pinky rang</p>
      <p begin="00:14.100" end="00:16.460" ttm:agent="v1">Lotta gang, lotta niggas, and a icy chain</p>
      <p begin="00:16.460" end="00:18.820" ttm:agent="v1">Why you claim that you rich? That's a false claim</p>
      <p begin="00:18.820" end="00:21.350" ttm:agent="v1">I be straight to the whip, no baggage claim</p>
      <p begin="00:21.350" end="00:23.680" ttm:agent="v1">Whole lotta styles, can't even pronounce the name</p>
      <p begin="00:23.680" end="00:26.270" ttm:agent="v1">You ain’t got no style, see you on my Instagram</p>
      <p begin="00:26.270" end="00:28.700" ttm:agent="v1">I be rockin' it like it's fresh out the pan</p>
      <p begin="00:28.700" end="00:31.080" ttm:agent="v1">Only when I'm takin' pics, I'm the middleman</p>
      <p begin="00:31.080" end="00:33.550" ttm:agent="v1">Walk, talk it like a boss, I just lift the hand</p>
      <p begin="00:33.550" end="00:36.020" ttm:agent="v1">3 million cash, call me rain man</p>
      <p begin="00:36.020" end="00:38.470" ttm:agent="v1">Money like a shower, that's my rain dance</p>
      <p begin="00:38.470" end="00:40.980" ttm:agent="v1">And we all in black, like it's gangland</p>
      <p begin="00:40.980" end="00:43.310" ttm:agent="v1">Say the wrong word, you be hangman</p>
      <p begin="00:43.310" end="00:45.820" ttm:agent="v1">Watch me stick to your b***h like a spray tan</p>
      <p begin="00:45.820" end="00:48.210" ttm:agent="v1">Aw, Mr. 'What Kind Of Car You In?'</p>
      <p begin="00:48.210" end="00:50.770" ttm:agent="v1">In the city love my name, bitch I ain't gotta say it</p>
      <p begin="00:50.770" end="00:52.820" ttm:agent="v1">Taste, taste, she can get a taste</p>
      <p begin="00:52.820" end="00:55.620" ttm:agent="v1">Taste, taste, she can get a taste</p>
      <p begin="00:55.620" end="00:58.740" ttm:agent="v1">Taste, taste, **** what a bitch say</p>
      <p begin="00:58.740" end="01:00.430" ttm:agent="v1">It's all the same, like Mary-Kate</p>
      <p begin="01:00.430" end="01:02.790" ttm:agent="v1">Taste, taste, she can get a taste</p>
      <p begin="01:02.790" end="01:05.410" ttm:agent="v1">Taste, taste, let you get a taste</p>
      <p begin="01:05.410" end="01:07.860" ttm:agent="v1">Taste, taste, do you love the taste?</p>
      <p begin="01:07.860" end="01:10.300" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah that's cool but he ain't like me</p>
      <p begin="01:10.300" end="01:13.010" ttm:agent="v1">Lotta girls like me, bitches wanna fight me</p>
      <p begin="01:13.010" end="01:15.270" ttm:agent="v1">B***h get yo ass checked like a ****ing Nike</p>
      <p begin="01:15.270" end="01:17.770" ttm:agent="v1">Me not icey, that's unlikely</p>
      <p begin="01:17.770" end="01:20.180" ttm:agent="v1">And she gon' suck me like a ****ing Hi-C</p>
      <p begin="01:20.180" end="01:22.450" ttm:agent="v1">Aw, chains on the neck for the whole team</p>
      <p begin="01:22.450" end="01:24.930" ttm:agent="v1">And I feel like Gucci with the ice cream</p>
      <p begin="01:24.930" end="01:27.450" ttm:agent="v1">And my b***h want the Fenty, not the Maybelline</p>
      <p begin="01:27.450" end="01:29.960" ttm:agent="v1">I'm the black JB the way these niggas scream</p>
      <p begin="01:29.960" end="01:33.730" ttm:agent="v1">Make these niggas scream</p>
      <p begin="01:33.730" end="01:35.910" ttm:agent="v1">Pretty little thing</p>
      <p begin="01:35.910" end="01:39.720" ttm:agent="v1">Like my nigga A.E, say, yadadamean</p>
      <p begin="01:39.720" end="01:42.080" ttm:agent="v1">Taste, taste, she can get a taste</p>
      <p begin="01:42.080" end="01:44.480" ttm:agent="v1">Taste, taste, she can get a taste</p>
